<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Censure's open book · Round 66 pass 2 · Grudgelands</title>
<style>
:root { color-scheme: dark; --bg:#101a24; --panel:#192631; --ink:#f5efdf; --muted:#b4c1ca; --gold:#e8ca89; --line:#34424d; }
* { box-sizing:border-box; }
html { scroll-behavior:smooth; }
body { margin:0; background:var(--bg); color:var(--ink); font:16px/1.55 system-ui,sans-serif; }
main { max-width:1320px; margin:auto; padding:44px 32px 64px; }
a { color:var(--gold); text-underline-offset:4px; }
nav { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; justify-content:space-between; gap:16px; padding-bottom:20px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); font-size:13px; }
nav strong, .eyebrow { text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.13em; font-size:11px; }
nav div { display:flex; gap:24px; }
h1, h2, h3 { font-family:Georgia,serif; font-weight:normal; }
h1 { font-size:clamp(42px,6vw,76px); line-height:1.05; margin:30px 0 18px; letter-spacing:-.04em; }
h2 { font-size:32px; margin:0; }
h3 { font-size:25px; margin:4px 0 10px; }
h4 { margin:0; font-size:16px; font-weight:600; }
p { margin:8px 0 14px; }
.intro { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.3fr 1fr; gap:44px; align-items:center; margin:30px 0 34px; }
.intro-copy { max-width:650px; color:var(--muted); font-size:18px; }
.recommendation { border:1px solid #716044; background:#242b2c; padding:24px; }
.recommendation h2 { font-size:28px; }
.recommendation p { font-size:14px; color:#d9d7cb; }
.recommendation .eyebrow { color:var(--gold); }
.pair { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:20px; margin-top:10px; }
.pair img { width:64px; height:64px; }
.pair a { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; font-size:14px; }
.notes { padding:18px 22px; border-left:3px solid var(--gold); background:var(--panel); color:var(--muted); font-size:14px; }
.notes strong { color:var(--ink); }
.section-head { display:flex; align-items:baseline; flex-wrap:wrap; justify-content:space-between; gap:8px; margin:42px 0 18px; }
.section-head p { color:var(--muted); font-size:14px; margin:0; }
.candidates { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:24px; }
.candidate { min-width:0; background:var(--panel); border:1px solid var(--line); padding:20px; }
.candidate-head { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:16px; min-height:166px; margin-bottom:16px; }
.candidate-head p { font-size:13px; color:var(--muted); }
.candidate-head .eyebrow { color:var(--gold); font-size:11px; }
.hero-sprite { flex:none; width:128px; height:144px; display:grid; place-items:center; }
.picked-card { display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(260px,1fr) minmax(420px,1.5fr); gap:24px; align-items:center; }
.picked-card .candidate-head { margin-bottom:0; }
.table-head, .surface-row { display:grid; grid-template-columns:46px 1fr 1fr; gap:6px; }
.table-head { color:var(--muted); font-size:11px; margin-bottom:8px; }
.table-head span:not(:first-child) { text-align:center; }
.surface-row { margin-bottom:6px; }
.surface-label { font-size:11px; display:flex; align-items:center; color:var(--muted); }
.surface { min-width:0; isolation:isolate; }
.night { background:#152337; color:#c8d8e4; }
.cave { background:#292629; color:#d7cfd5; }
.snow { background:#e8edf3; color:#485766; }
.sky { background:#96c9e5; color:#254457; }
.sand { background:#d5bb86; color:#493d2d; }
.samples { display:flex; justify-content:space-evenly; gap:4px; padding:7px 3px 4px; }
.sample { display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:flex-end; min-height:84px; }
.sample span { font-size:9px; margin-top:3px; }
img { object-fit:contain; }
.add img { mix-blend-mode:screen; }
@supports (mix-blend-mode:plus-lighter) { .add img { mix-blend-mode:plus-lighter; } }
.blend-fallback { display:none; }
@supports not (mix-blend-mode:plus-lighter) { .blend-fallback { display:block; color:var(--gold); } }
.contexts { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:24px; }
.context-card { border:1px solid var(--line); background:var(--panel); padding:20px; }
.context-card > h3 { color:var(--gold); }
.scale-strip { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:12px; }
.scale-cell { min-width:0; }
.scale-cell p { font-size:10px; color:var(--muted); min-height:31px; }
.scene { max-width:320px; margin:auto; height:220px; position:relative; isolation:isolate; background:linear-gradient(#203146 0%,#203146 87%,#425044 87%,#344237 100%); overflow:hidden; }
.symbol { position:absolute; left:calc(50% - 48px); top:90px; transform:translate(-50%,-50%); z-index:2; }
.figure { width:64px; height:128px; position:absolute; left:calc(50% + 12px); bottom:28px; color:#82929c; }
.figure i { position:absolute; display:block; background:currentColor; }
.head { width:23px; height:23px; top:0; left:20px; border-radius:7px 7px 4px 4px; }
.body { width:32px; height:51px; top:27px; left:16px; border-radius:5px 5px 2px 2px; }
.arms { top:29px; left:0; width:64px; height:47px; clip-path:polygon(0 0,100% 0,100% 100%,84% 100%,77% 22%,23% 22%,16% 100%,0 100%); }
.legs { top:74px; left:17px; width:30px; height:54px; clip-path:polygon(0 0,100% 0,100% 100%,60% 100%,50% 20%,40% 100%,0 100%); }
.ruler { position:absolute; width:64px; left:calc(50% + 12px); bottom:4px; border-top:1px solid #afbac0; font-size:9px; text-align:center; }
.size-note { margin-bottom:0; }
footer { margin-top:36px; padding-top:20px; border-top:1px solid var(--line); font-size:13px; color:var(--muted); }
code { color:var(--ink); font-size:.92em; }
@media (max-width:1100px) { .candidates, .contexts { grid-template-columns:1fr; } .candidate-head { min-height:145px; } }
@media (max-width:900px) { .picked-card { grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:8px; } }
@media (max-width:720px) { main { padding:24px 14px; } .intro { grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:16px; } .scale-strip { gap:8px; } .context-card { padding:12px; } .candidate { padding:12px; } }
@media (max-width:800px) { .scale-strip { grid-template-columns:1fr; } .scene { width:240px; margin:auto; } .scale-cell { text-align:center; } }
@media (max-width:440px) { .candidate-head { gap:8px; } .hero-sprite { width:80px; } .hero-sprite img { width:80px; height:80px; } .table-head, .surface-row { grid-template-columns:33px 1fr 1fr; gap:3px; } .samples { gap:1px; padding-inline:1px; } .sample span { font-size:8px; } .surface-label { font-size:9px; } .pair { gap:8px; } .pair a { font-size:12px; } .scale-cell h4 { font-size:13px; } }
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce) { html { scroll-behavior:auto; } }
</style>
</head>
<body><main>
<nav><strong>Grudgelands / Art study 66 / Pass 2</strong><div><a href="#hammers">Picked hammer</a><a href="#books">Open books</a><a href="#scale">In context</a></div></nav>
<div class="intro">
<div><p class="eyebrow">Priest · Smite / Final Word / Censure</p><h1>The open word.</h1><p class="intro-copy">Hammer A is picked. For Censure, two open books face the viewer: symmetric pages, a central spine, and a quiet glow.</p></div>
<aside class="recommendation"><p class="eyebrow">Artist's recommendation · Book C</p><h2>Picked Hammer A + Book C</h2><p>C's broad, flat spread gives the clearest open-book shape at 16 px. D offers taller, gently lifted pages. Both face forward throughout the fall and share the picked hammer's light palette.</p><div class="pair"><a href="#smite_hammer_a"><img src="smite_hammer_a.png" width="64" height="64" alt="Picked hammer A">Hammer A</a><a href="#censure_book_c"><img src="censure_book_c.png" width="64" height="64" alt="Recommended book C">Book C</a></div></aside>
</div>
<div class="notes"><strong>Read at 100% browser zoom.</strong> Each ground is shown in plain alpha and additive light, at actual 16, 32 and 64 CSS px. White, ivory and pale gold; bright edges, transparent gaps, a tight light halo. All three shown textures are 64 × 64 RGBA.<br><strong>Bright-ground limit:</strong> additive light cannot darken snow. Near-white ground washes out the interior tones; the tests below deliberately show that loss. These are browser approximations, with no game tint applied.<span class="blend-fallback">This browser uses screen blending as the fallback; it does not support plus-lighter.</span></div>
<section id="hammers"><div class="section-head"><h2>01 / Hammer A · picked</h2><p>Unchanged art and views · Smite small · Final Word large</p></div>@@HAMMERS@@</section>
<section id="books"><div class="section-head"><h2>02 / Censure's open book</h2><p>Front view · Symmetric spread · No lettering</p></div><div class="candidates">@@BOOKS@@</div></section>
<section id="scale"><div class="section-head"><h2>03 / Beside a figure</h2><p>Static size study · Additive light</p></div><p class="intro-copy">One node is 64 CSS px. Each figure is one node wide and two tall. The three sprite squares use the planned particle sizes 5 / 12 / 16; transparent margins make the visible objects smaller.</p><div class="contexts">@@CONTEXT@@</div><p class="notes">Scale follows the existing effect catalogue preview: one size unit = 0.1 node. These are stills, not a timing or impact simulation. The existing rings and Final Word's column will be combined with the picked symbols by the FX lane; desktop and web acceptance follows in game.</p></section>
<footer><p><strong>Why 64 px?</strong> Both symbols keep simple shapes for the 16 px view; 64 px gives the larger falls smooth edges and room for the open pages and central fold without extra ornament.</p><p>Original geometry drawn for Grudgelands by GPT-6 Astra. Candidate art: CC0-1.0. Generated locally with Python, Pillow and numpy. No external assets or requests. <a href="contact-sheet.png">Open the contact sheet</a>.</p></footer>
</main></body></html>
